WEBVTT

00:21:29.379 --> 00:21:33.894
We're starting to see
unifiers, integrators

00:21:33.918 --> 00:21:37.524
of the individual systems
into this system of systems,

00:21:37.548 --> 00:21:40.628
which I think can talk to the world
and transform the world.

00:21:41.120 --> 00:21:42.422
This is essential

00:21:42.446 --> 00:21:46.310
if we are going to evolve
to a society that's sustainable.

00:21:46.656 --> 00:21:47.830
SR: Great.

00:21:47.854 --> 00:21:50.469
I think that is a perfect place to stop.

00:21:51.291 --> 00:21:52.778
Thank you so much.

00:21:52.802 --> 00:21:55.436
This was really wonderful.

00:21:55.460 --> 00:21:58.688
I'm really, really glad
that we got to do this.